graph TD
    A[User opens My Collection] --> B{Has banned cards?}
    B -->|Yes| C[BanAlertBanner displayed above grid]
    B -->|No| D[Normal collection view]

    C --> E[User scrolls card grid]
    E --> F{Card banned/restricted?}
    F -->|Yes| G["Red BANNED or Yellow RESTRICTED badge on card tile"]
    F -->|No| H[Normal card tile]

    G --> I{Recently changed?}
    I -->|Yes| J["Red ring highlight + pulsing badge"]
    I -->|No| G

    E --> K[User clicks card tile]
    K --> L[CollectionCardDetail page]
    L --> M[LegalityPanel shows all formats]

    M --> N{Any recently changed?}
    N -->|Yes| O["'NEW' cyan chip + tooltip with change details"]
    N -->|No| P[Standard LegalityBadge display]

    M --> Q{More than 8 formats?}
    Q -->|Yes| R["'Show all N formats' expander button"]
    Q -->|No| S[All formats visible]

    C --> T[User clicks dismiss X]
    T --> U[Banner hidden for session]
    U --> V[sessionStorage stores dismissed state]
